        "text": "Muse Spark is actually insanely good. \n\nIMO, for my uses, the only advantage Claude . ai has on it currently from dozens of hours working with both is 1) coding and 2) context retention within and across chats.  \n\nBuilt a little app to learn - I've been using Claude as project https://t.co/M79BTU3mbM"
