        "text": "🚀 Muse Spark Safety &amp; Preparedness Report for Meta AI is out.\n\nWe start with our pre-deployment assessment under Meta's Advanced AI Scaling Framework, covering chemical and biological, cybersecurity, and loss of control risks. Our assessment flagged potentially elevated chem/bio"
