        "text": "The coolest thing Meta AI's Muse Spark can do by far is counting objects!\n\nAs you can tell, it's far from perfect. They call it \"visual grounding\" and it can count objects and do bounding boxes. I've been playing with the new model and here's what I think so far:\n\nGood stuff:\n– https://t.co/5lGNPNxURs"
